WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.069 --> 00:00:17.370
flew around the statue.

2
00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:20.831
"Where is the water coming from?"

3
00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:21.792
he thought.

4
00:00:23.452 --> 00:00:25.973
Then he saw the statue's eyes.

5
00:00:27.914 --> 00:00:28.654
He gasped.

6
00:00:28.674 --> 00:00:32.196
"Are those tears streaming from his eyes?

7
00:00:33.996 --> 00:00:34.977
It can't be."

8
00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:36.798
But it was!

9
00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:42.281
Swallow perched on the statue's shoulder for a closer look.

10
00:00:43.322 --> 00:00:47.084
And indeed, tears were flowing from the statue's eyes.

11
00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:52.527
"But statues don't cry," Swallow said.

12
00:00:52.547 --> 00:00:55.769
"Especially not happy statues."

13
00:00:55.789 --> 00:01:00.711
"Well, looks aren't everything!"

14
00:01:00.731 --> 00:01:01.532
a voice said.

15
00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:03.788
"Who said that?"

16
00:01:04.849 --> 00:01:05.809
Swallow looked around.

17
00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:09.130
There was no one there.

18
00:01:11.651 --> 00:01:12.692
Swallow shook his head.

19
00:01:12.712 --> 00:01:15.473
"I've got to get out of this town.

20
00:01:16.533 --> 00:01:18.134
Strange things are happening!

21
00:01:19.715 --> 00:01:20.695
Statues that cry.

22
00:01:20.715 --> 00:01:22.016
A voice from nowhere.

23
00:01:22.036 --> 00:01:25.297
I will leave for Egypt at first light!"

24
00:01:25.317 --> 00:01:30.299
"At least you can leave," the voice said.

25
00:01:31.639 --> 00:01:32.780
Swallow couldn't believe it.

26
00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.041
The statue was talking to him!

27
00:01:37.762 --> 00:01:38.963
He flapped his wings.

28
00:01:38.983 --> 00:01:41.304
"Are you alive in there?"

29
00:01:45.547 --> 00:01:46.187
I am."

30
00:01:49.149 --> 00:01:50.950
The statue sighed deeply.

31
00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:56.153
"How did you get inside a statue?"

32
00:01:56.633 --> 00:01:57.474
Swallow asked.

33
00:01:57.494 --> 00:02:00.556
"It was a magic spell.

34
00:02:03.024 --> 00:02:06.187
I used to be a boy, and I was so happy.

35
00:02:06.207 --> 00:02:11.411
I didn't have a care in the world," the statue said.

36
00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:16.175
"My parents, the king and queen, loved me very much.

37
00:02:17.696 --> 00:02:19.157
They said I was perfect.

38
00:02:20.398 --> 00:02:23.601
Everyone at the castle called me the Happy Prince."

39
00:02:28.385 --> 00:02:29.586
"You still look happy.

40
00:02:30.747 --> 00:02:32.028
So why are you crying?"

41
00:02:32.392 --> 00:02:33.253
Swallow asked.

42
00:02:33.273 --> 00:02:38.755
"Because now I'm sad all the time," the statue said.

43
00:02:38.775 --> 00:02:42.737
"I guess I'd be sad too, if I was a statue.

44
00:02:43.857 --> 00:02:45.878
Then I couldn't fly fast like this!"

45
00:02:48.139 --> 00:02:50.060
Swallow zoomed around the statue.

46
00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:54.743
"Or look at beautiful things—like you and my darling.

47
00:02:56.183 --> 00:02:57.564
Well, never mind."

48
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:03.703
"I wish I was a boy again," the statue said.

49
00:03:03.723 --> 00:03:06.766
"But that's not why I'm crying.

50
00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:10.409
It's because so many people are sad."

51
00:03:10.429 --> 00:03:12.932
"They are?"

52
00:03:13.412 --> 00:03:14.053
Swallow said.

53
00:03:14.073 --> 00:03:16.154
"I never noticed."

54
00:03:16.174 --> 00:03:21.980
"My nursemaid tried to teach me to think about others.

55
00:03:23.661 --> 00:03:26.264
But I never listened," the statue said.

56
00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:32.141
"And now all I see is the misery of the world.

57
00:03:33.302 --> 00:03:36.083
Yet I am helpless to do anything about it."

58
00:03:36.103 --> 00:03:41.865
"Your smile must make people happy," Swallow said.

59
00:03:44.486 --> 00:03:45.807
The statue scoffed.

60
00:03:45.827 --> 00:03:49.808
"My smile doesn't feed them.

61
00:03:50.829 --> 00:03:52.950
It doesn't keep them warm at night."

62
00:03:56.451 --> 00:03:58.632
After that, the statue stopped talking.

63
00:04:01.596 --> 00:04:03.477
Swallow rested near the statue’s feet.

64
00:04:05.099 --> 00:04:07.660
Swallow thought about telling the prince about his reed.

65
00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.422
She was now brown and wilted.

66
00:04:11.403 --> 00:04:12.404
But he stopped himself.

67
00:04:12.424 --> 00:04:17.167
"This statue doesn't need to hear another sad story!"

68
00:04:17.767 --> 00:04:18.668
Swallow thought.
